hardn  v0.4.0              https://github.com/abbott/hardn$
$
# Alpine 3.24.2 ################################################$
$
  [web-01]                 192.0.2.20$
                           3 days, 5 hours, 12 minutes$
$
  [*] Risk Level           Moderate ~ medium security$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, doas$
  [+] SSH Login            Configured root locked$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured key-only auth$
  [ ] SSH Port             Not Configured default (22)$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured ufw not installed$
  [-] DNS                  Not Applicable no hardn.yml$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured no apk-cron$
  [-] AppArmor             Not Applicable Alpine default$
$
   # Warning: CVE-2026-123158$
   # Upgrade openssh.$
   # Select option: 2) SSH Login$
$
----------------------------------------------------------------$
$
  Select an option         Mode Live$
$
   1) User Management      Create, configure (sudo, SSH keys)$
   2) SSH Login            Root login, passwords, port$
   3) Firewall             Configure ufw rules$
   4) DNS                  Configure nameservers$
   6) Run All              Execute hardening operations$
   7) Backup               Configure hardn backup$
   8) Environment          Keep HARDN_CONFIG$
   9) System Details       View system information$
  10) Logs                 View log file$
$
   0) Exit                 q to quit$
$
    > Option [0-4, 6-10 or q]:$
$
